# Detection Example

The following detection identifies repeated SSH authentication failures.

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| where RawData has "Failed password"
| extend SourceIP = extract(@"from ([0-9.]+)",1,RawData)
| summarize Attempts=count() by SourceIP
| where Attempts > 5
| order by Attempts desc
```

Detection logic:

- Search authentication failures.
- Extract source IP addresses.
- Count repeated attempts.
- Generate an alert if failures exceed the defined threshold.

